{
  "info": {
    "name": "MSTCONNECT Capstone 2 API",
    "description": "E-Commerce REST API - product CRUD, search/filter, validation and error handling.\n\nSetup:\n1. Start the API with `npm run dev`.\n2. Set the collection variable `baseUrl` to http://localhost:5000 (already set by default).\n3. Run \"Create Product\" first - it saves the new _id into the `productId` variable automatically, so View / Update / Delete just work.\n\nEvery request has tests attached. Use Postman's Collection Runner to execute the whole suite at once.\n\nAUTH: Run \"Register - Admin\" or \"Login\" first. The token is saved into the {{token}} variable automatically and every protected request inherits it from the collection-level Bearer auth.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "JWT authentication. Register or log in to get a token; the collection attaches it to every protected request as an Authorization: Bearer header.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register - Admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Admin User\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secret123\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Creates an admin account. Only admins may DELETE products. Run this once; a second run returns 400 (duplicate email), which is correct."
          },
          "auth": {
            "type": "noauth"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('returns a token', () => pm.expect(b.token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.test('password is never echoed back', () => pm.expect(JSON.stringify(b)).to.not.include('secret123'));",
                  "pm.test('role is admin', () => pm.expect(b.data.role).to.eql('admin'));",
                  "if (b.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', b.token); pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', b.token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Register - Regular User",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
